Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.10,0:03:43.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.45,0:00:40.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 没关系 我一般也起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, it's cool. I'm usually up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.98,0:00:43.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前整整七年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to open for a coffee shop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都给咖啡店开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every day for seven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.45,0:00:50.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大脑会保留一些你不需要的习惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your brain, it gets wired to things you don't need anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.23,0:00:53.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还喜欢随身带着手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still like carrying around my cell phone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:56.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后它会响铃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of these days it's gonna ring
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.68,0:00:58.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后吓我一大跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and freak my ass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:01.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你碰巧打到野猪 能分我一条腿吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, if you happen to bag a boar out there, can I have a leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.55,0:01:04.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来做意大利熏火腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To make a prosciutto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:08.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾变前我就在地下室熏肉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to cure meats in my basement even before all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:11.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做的泡菜也超好吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made some kick-ass pickles, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.19,0:01:12.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行 奥利维亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:19.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.21,0:03:04.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来杀了我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.49,0:03:56.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没看见 但它就在附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see it, but it's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:03:59.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's just one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:01.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会久留的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't be here long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:03.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么看？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.48,0:04:04.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等里面没人了我们就进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can go in when it's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.71,0:04:06.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么做？晚上那里会锁门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is that? It's locked up at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.90,0:04:09.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走窗户 只有个插销 我可以拉开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The window. There's just a latch. I can leave it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.99,0:04:12.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 插销？- 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A latch? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.82,0:04:14.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一某个蠢货扣上了呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if one of those pricks shuts it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:17.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就等几天 再拉开插销\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a couple of days, leave it open again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:19.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它越来越近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:21.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们越早做越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to do it sooner than later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.55,0:04:22.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他们没监视我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now, they're not watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:25.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没担心这种会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not worrying about meetings like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.13,0:04:28.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也许需要枪 也许不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may need the guns, we may not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:30.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样 我们都需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will whatever way it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.55,0:04:32.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是我见过的最幸运的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're the luckiest damn people I ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:35.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而他们越来越幸运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they just keep getting luckier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:36.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎讲？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:38.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:43.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有几个小箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got a couple of footlockers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.35,0:04:45.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面都是9毫米自动枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just full of 9 millimeter autos,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:46.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲁格手枪 卡尔特克步枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rugers, Kel-Tecs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:49.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就扔在里面 他们不用那些枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just tossed in there. They don't use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:50.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远也不会知道不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're never gonna know they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.95,0:04:53.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人已经拿了一把 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's got one now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:05:00.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 其他人 让他们努力融合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, the others, we want them to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.75,0:05:01.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:05.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不要声张 我们三个知道就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we keep it quiet. Just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:07.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.03,0:05:10.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我来 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got him. - Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:23.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们说的是带我出来练枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We said we were taking me out shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:25.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去时弹夹可不能是满的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't go back with a full mag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:27.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真幸运 它来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky he came by.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:29.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:34.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拉开插销 我们伺机行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll pull the latch, we'll pick our moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:36.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没必要靠运气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Us, we don't need to be lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:39.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.91,0:05:43.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个W吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a W?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:45.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:31.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这是不是什么把戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if this is some kind of play,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:34.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把权力交给陌生人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}handing authority to strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:36.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,制止打架斗殴的权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The authority to break up fistfights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.27,0:06:40.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果真是那样 她也该给达里尔一套警服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it was just that, she should have given one of these to Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:43.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这是为了我们还是他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if it's for us or for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.83,0:06:48.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许迪安娜真想除掉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe Deanna's trying to get rid of us and them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.62,0:06:51.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是让我俩穿上警服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You put these jackets on me and you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:54.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人们都看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have the people see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:57.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是把戏 那真聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's the play, that'd be smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.51,0:07:01.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她看起来挺聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she seems smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:05.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时聪明还是现在聪明？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smart for then or smart for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.81,0:07:08.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:24.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:26.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:42.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你凭声音就能分辨行尸和人类吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can tell the difference between walkers and humans by sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.64,0:07:51.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能分辨好人和坏人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you tell the difference between a good guy and a bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.81,0:07:54.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克好像不怎么擅长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick doesn't seem to be an expert at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:56.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在没什么区别了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There ain't much of a difference no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:07:57.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你对你同伴的看法吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That how you feel about your people?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:07:59.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么跟踪我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:02.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你也在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:04.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是出来打兔子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came out to hunt rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.65,0:08:09.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你为什么出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know why you're out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.04,0:08:13.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,介意我加入吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind if I join?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:19.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.39,0:08:21.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:27.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你保护人民 服务大众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You protect and serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:30.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巡逻 沿墙警戒 照看孩童\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You patrol, walk the wall, watch out for the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:33.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如出现了冲突 你就去解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's a conflict, you solve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.02,0:08:35.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家会听你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And people will listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:37.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们穿着防风衣吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we're wearing windbreakers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:39.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们相信这身制服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because they believe in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.53,0:08:42.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我要求他们这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm telling them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:46.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里曾经住了个警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A police officer used to live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:48.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们有这些警服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we had these jackets
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.02,0:08:49.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我希望弄得正式一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I wanted to make it official.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:51.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样才有权威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's official.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:54.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天这里会有政府的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's gonna be a government here one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:57.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是为什么我希望玛姬来协助我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I want Maggie working with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:08:59.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将来还会有一个警队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's gonna be a police force.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:01.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我希望你俩起个头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I want you two to start it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:04.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了一个生机勃勃的社区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see a vibrant community here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.47,0:09:08.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有工业 有商业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with industry, commerce,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:09.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有文明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:12.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.79,0:09:15.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能只是很原始的生活 但是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It might be horses and mills, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.62,0:09:16.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:19.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听上去像是异想天开吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that sound like pie in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:21.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:24.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.71,0:09:28.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.93,0:09:31.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能谈谈安保工作吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we talk security?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:34.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要墙边一直有人巡逻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a constant patrol along the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:36.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不仅仅是查看哪里有缺口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not just looking for damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:39.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要警戒是否有人爬进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but signs that anyone climbed in from outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.11,0:09:44.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以顺着支柱爬上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can move right up the supports.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.26,0:09:46.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就会那样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.57,0:09:49.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今人类才是真正的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are the real threat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.49,0:09:51.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克 我知道你觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick, I know you think
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.03,0:09:53.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙内人人都应该武装起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we should all be armed within the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:55.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能那样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.53,0:09:58.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:00.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你照我说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make these changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.55,0:10:02.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不用武装了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we won't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:03.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.51,0:10:11.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我申请在钟塔上放哨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to volunteer to be one of the lookouts in the clock tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:13.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钟塔上没人放哨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no lookouts in the clock tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:15.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？- 之前我们看见上面有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - We saw someone up there earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.57,0:10:19.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我儿子斯宾塞放上去的空膛步枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was an empty rifle my son Spencer put up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:22.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有时会上去 但不经常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He mans it sometimes, but not often.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:25.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 没有放哨的必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, there hasn't been the need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:29.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要立刻在塔上设哨 时刻戒备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a lookout in that tower right now, 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.85,0:10:31.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这样才能提前发现敌情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way we'll be able to see if someone's coming at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:33.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我们轮班放哨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay, we'll make shifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:35.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会尽可能多轮几班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take those shifts, as many as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:39.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.69,0:10:42.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙是我们最好的射手之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sasha's one of our best shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.98,0:10:44.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:49.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我会让斯宾塞上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna put Spencer up there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:51.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会考虑让你成为我们的主要哨兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll consider you being our primary lookout,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:53.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我想要一点回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I want something in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:59.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚 我在我家为你们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight I'm hosting a welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:01.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举办了一个欢迎会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for all of you at my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.03,0:11:04.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你能到场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:06.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.42,0:11:10.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚过来 然后我们再谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come tonight. Then we'll talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:14.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,青豆泥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mashed lima beans,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:16.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可可粉 再加一点甜味剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cocoa powder, a little sweetener.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:19.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾变前我也会吃的 我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have eaten it before all this, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.18,0:11:21.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它含蛋白质 能填饱肚子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's protein and it fills you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:23.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来真可口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.63,0:11:27.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我等下回来 我得去求瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be back. I've got to go beg Rick
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚帮帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for some help with tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:30.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如你还需要其他什么就告诉我 姐妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need anything else, you hit me, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:32.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 谢啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:38.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听说了派对的事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've heard about the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:40.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人人都会到场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone's gonna be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:40.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.57,0:11:43.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就今晚行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So tonight, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:46.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该可以溜出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should be able to slip out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.84,0:11:49.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,武器库就在迪安娜家旁边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The armory is right next to Deanna's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:50.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会支援你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll back you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.57,0:11:53.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家可能会好奇新治安官或者卡尔的爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People might wonder where their new constable is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:55.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or Carl's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:57.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:11:59.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能用达里尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't use Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.71,0:12:01.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家在盯着他的一举一动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're watching every move he makes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:03.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.77,0:12:05.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这里好在哪里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what's great about this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.51,0:12:08.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又能变成隐形人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get to be invisible again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.70,0:12:35.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想抓住它已经好几个月了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been trying to catch him for months,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.88,0:12:37.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想把它带回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bring him inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.18,0:12:39.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它叫巴顿斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.22,0:12:44.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个孩子以前看到它从门口跑过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the kids saw him run by the gate a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.10,0:12:46.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得它应该叫巴顿斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought he looked like a Buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:49.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经好久没看到它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't seen him for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:52.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还担心它死了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was afraid it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:12:59.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次埃里克和我靠近它 就会吓着它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time Eric or I come close, he gets spooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:03.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前套过马吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you done this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.57,0:13:05.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们那伙儿人套过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My group did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:07.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是它们没在外面待那么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they weren't out there that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:12.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在外面待得越久就越野性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The longer they're out there, the more they become what they really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.47,0:13:26.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会伤害你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't gonna hurt ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.94,0:13:27.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:30.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:31.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:34.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续吃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just keep on eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:36.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.31,0:13:38.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:41.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前也是有主人的 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you used to be somebody's, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.25,0:13:45.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你是自己的主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're just yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.59,0:13:48.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 它们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, they're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:11.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:16.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的用苹果酱替代鸡蛋吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really substitute applesauce for eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.90,0:14:18.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是毁我三观了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could change my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.77,0:14:20.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事儿只有你知我知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can keep that between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.35,0:14:22.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是这些饼干的秘方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sort of the secret to these cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:23.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:25.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.31,0:14:27.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女生总得有些秘密呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A girl's got only so many secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:28.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会守口如瓶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll die with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.19,0:14:31.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巧克力比较紧缺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, the chocolate is kind of a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:33.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的有巧克力吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You actually have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:35.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只能给你一小块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can only ration you a quarter bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.11,0:14:36.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,足够用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.68,0:14:38.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥利维亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:41.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来取枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna need to make a withdrawal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.15,0:14:42.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么晚啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Late start?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.22,0:14:43.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女老板让我在派对开始前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boss lady wants me to check
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.24,0:14:45.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,检查一下东墙的支杆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that strut on the east wall before the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:46.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去后面拿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head on back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.54,0:14:49.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔 需要什么随便拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carol, just grab what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:51.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 巧克力在大厅的冰柜里 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Chocolate's in the hall freezer. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.96,0:15:10.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怕枪吗 女士？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You afraid of guns, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:13.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不怕 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.71,0:15:16.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在外面的时候有一把手枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I had a handgun and I carried a rifle
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:19.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和一支步枪 但是我不太会用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when we were on the outside, but I'm not an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:22.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少不会用那种枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not with those, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:26.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫托宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my name is Tobin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.95,0:15:31.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想学的话 我可以教你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And whenever you want, i'd be happy to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.49,0:15:33.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防万一嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just better to be safe than sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.15,0:15:36.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那真好 谢了 托宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'd be nice. Thanks, Tobin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.66,0:15:38.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 奥利维亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:51.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会骑马吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ride horses?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:53.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会骑车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ride bikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.34,0:15:57.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你说的不是自行车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take it you don't mean 10-speeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:03.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你觉得自己是外人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're feeling like an outsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.70,0:16:07.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not your fault, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.56,0:16:09.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃里克和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.67,0:16:13.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们很多时候依然把我们看成外人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're still looked at as outsiders in a lot of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:19.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们听过很多正派的人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've heard our fair share of well-meaning,but ...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.55,0:16:22.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我们开一些没有恶意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hilariously offensive things
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.05,0:16:24.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但非常难听的玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from some otherwise really nice men and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:27.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是人的本性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:31.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,越是害怕 越是愚蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more afraid they get, the more stupid they get.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.63,0:16:35.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐惧会让智商降低\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear shrinks the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.46,0:16:41.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们因为不同的理由害怕你和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're scared of you and me for different reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:45.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为认识我 所以他们不那么怕我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're less scared of me because they know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.93,0:16:48.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日复一日渐渐不怕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's less and less every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.13,0:16:51.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:54.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们认识认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let them get to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:58.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚应该去参加迪安娜的派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should go to Deanna's party tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.99,0:17:00.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没什么可证明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got nothing to prove.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.13,0:17:05.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在外面遇到过很多坏人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I met a lot of bad people out here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:07.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们干了很多坏事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doing a lot of bad shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.37,0:17:09.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们什么都不怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They weren't afraid of nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.84,0:17:12.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:25.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:28.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:31.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们能来太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's so good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.81,0:17:34.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔 感谢你们能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Carl. Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:37.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 我还没面试她呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I didn't get a chance to interview this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:39.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我羡慕她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I envy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:40.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:43.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有机会见证这地方的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll get to see what this place will become.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.40,0:17:45.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.28,0:18:06.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不太习惯这种场合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.18,0:18:11.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:15.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:26.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克 这是我丈夫雷吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick, this is my husband Reg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.23,0:18:31.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个很出色的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a pretty remarkable guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.89,0:18:33.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话怎么说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, how's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.36,0:18:36.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看了录像带 所有人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I watched the tapes. All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:38.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家对你的评价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The things those people said about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.32,0:18:39.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为他们做过的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The things you did for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:43.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面的墙不是你建的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't you build that wall out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:46.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 是我 有人帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I did, with help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.11,0:18:50.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多人帮我 虽说是个不可思议的成就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of it. And it's a damned incredible achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:53.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 也不过是面墙而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.60,0:18:58.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十四个人 在这种世界？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14 lives in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:01.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你比我厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you have me beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.46,0:19:05.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在都受到墙的保护 所以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we're standing behind that wall right now, dear. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:06.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩是平手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's call it a tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.39,0:19:10.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴你能加入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:13.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在 喝一杯吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, take a glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.18,0:19:14.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.59,0:19:17.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不用绷着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.94,0:19:24.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:25.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:31.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好 欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.59,0:19:32.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.63,0:19:50.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得快点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta move quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.75,0:19:52.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它被包围了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's pinned in with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.51,0:19:56.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去对付远处的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the far ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:18.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:27.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.91,0:20:54.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对付右边的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the ones on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.61,0:21:09.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.53,0:21:32.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它总在跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He always ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.85,0:21:43.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你尽过力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were trying to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.86,0:22:05.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:07.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.32,0:22:09.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.59,0:22:12.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是不太适应这个场合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just isn't really my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.23,0:22:17.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我还是走吧 - 别走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think I'm gonna head out. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.42,0:22:18.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not bailing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.06,0:22:20.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家一起受罪呢 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in this together, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.47,0:22:23.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在跟我们在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're here with us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.23,0:22:25.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟家人在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're here with family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:30.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.59,0:22:49.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:54.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你去了那边的派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought you were going to that party over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.55,0:22:56.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我压根没打算去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I was never going to go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.67,0:22:59.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为埃里克脚踝受伤了 感谢上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of Eric's ankle, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.04,0:23:01.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么让我去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the hell did you tell me to go, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.89,0:23:04.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说让你试试 你试了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said try. You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.83,0:23:07.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有这个心本身就很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a thought that counts thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.58,0:23:11.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 - 进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - Hey, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.26,0:23:12.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃点晚饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have some dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.00,0:23:17.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.26,0:23:19.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有很正宗的意粉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's some pretty serious spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.26,0:23:28.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧 她来了 说明武器库没人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, she's here, which means it's empty, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.84,0:23:31.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和你一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.41,0:23:32.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 记住…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.92,0:23:35.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是隐形人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.25,0:23:39.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克 这是我丈夫皮特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Rick, this is my husband Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.33,0:23:41.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.96,0:23:44.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你担任我们的治安官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to thank you for taking on being our constable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.75,0:23:45.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果社区照此速度发展下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we keep growing at this rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.74,0:23:46.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能还需要更多的治安官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're gonna need even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.82,0:23:48.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.50,0:23:49.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下周来我办公室一趟吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to come by my office next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.99,0:23:51.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为你做个检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take a look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.76,0:23:55.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我应该事先讲明自己是个医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I probably should have said I was a doctor first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.42,0:23:56.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先说后说都挺体贴的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it sounded nice either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.92,0:23:59.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去给我们续杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to get us a refill.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.82,0:24:01.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我去吧 - 我说了我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, I can do it. - I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.93,0:24:06.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开心吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.36,0:24:10.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺开心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.94,0:24:15.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这问题挺蠢的 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's kind of a stupid question, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.42,0:24:16.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.69,0:24:21.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 这里看上去挺不错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still, this place has a pretty amazing view.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.19,0:24:24.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.63,0:24:26.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.08,0:24:35.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像以前一样的平凡生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ordinary life like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.54,0:24:39.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和以前也不大一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, not like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.03,0:24:40.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.28,0:24:43.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.37,0:24:46.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想说的是… 至少更好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean... I mean, it's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.63,0:24:48.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是说外面 而是这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not out there, in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.40,0:24:53.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都经历过苦痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, everyone's been through it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.44,0:24:55.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.95,0:24:58.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多好东西消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a lot of things disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.15,0:25:02.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是很多糟粕也消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But a lot of bullshit went with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.12,0:25:07.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都有其截然不同的背景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all from totally different backgrounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.77,0:25:08.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来自不同的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}different places.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.88,0:25:11.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来此生不会相见 然而…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They never would have even met. And ...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.28,0:25:14.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他们却是彼此生活的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now they're part of each other's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.00,0:25:16.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就是彼此的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are each other's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.27,0:25:22.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想说 人人都会失去一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just saying, we all lost things,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.83,0:25:25.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但有失必有得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we got something back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.20,0:25:29.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然那还不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.62,0:25:30.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但至少有所得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.47,0:25:35.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 是平手 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it was a tie, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.85,0:25:37.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也看到了 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.96,0:25:48.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的没错 确实挺不错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, it's a pretty good view.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.73,0:25:53.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 妈 - 什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.68,0:25:54.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没饼干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no more cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.39,0:25:58.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚好认识做饼干的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I happen to know the cookie maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.74,0:26:00.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是我的好友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a good friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.88,0:26:03.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许我可以去让她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I might be able to see about her
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.00,0:26:05.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为你做一整炉的饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}making a whole batch just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.20,0:26:07.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈 他手上没盖章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, he doesn't have a stamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.10,0:26:10.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想盖个章吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want a stamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.61,0:26:11.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.21,0:26:22.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见了没？你已经正式成为我们的一员了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? Now you're officially one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.38,0:26:24.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.75,0:26:25.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.41,0:26:27.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 等等 别乱跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, wait, don't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.77,0:26:32.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们待会见 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll see you later. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.21,0:26:53.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想逃走是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trying to make a getaway, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.58,0:26:56.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以装作没开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can pretend I didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.82,0:27:01.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是萨沙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.83,0:27:07.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是斯宾塞 迪安娜是我的母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Spencer. Deanna's my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.42,0:27:08.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你母亲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.61,0:27:11.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她看上去人很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she seems nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.83,0:27:13.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你跟我待在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you want to hang with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.07,0:27:15.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以确保你不被尼德迈尔夫人缠住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make sure you don't get stuck with Mrs. Neudermyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.80,0:27:17.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她真的特别喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She really, really likes
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.30,0:27:20.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟别人讲自己多想要一个面条机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}talking about how much she wants a pasta maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.97,0:27:23.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对不想聊那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a conversation you want to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.14,0:27:25.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失陪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.56,0:27:41.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.59,0:27:46.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出去的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm, when you're out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.93,0:27:49.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你恰好在商店里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you happen to be in a store or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.18,0:27:51.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼德迈尔夫人很想要一台面条机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Neudermyer is really looking for a pasta maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.75,0:27:54.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都不想再听她念叨这事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're all really trying to get her to shut up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.74,0:27:57.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这有好几箱干意面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, we have crates of dried pasta in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.89,0:28:00.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她非要自己做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but she wants to make her own or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.70,0:28:02.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得她只是想找点话头吧 所以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really think she just wants something to talk about, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.93,0:28:06.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你出去时有看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you see one out on your travels,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.48,0:28:08.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那真是帮了我们一个大忙…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would go a long way to...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.97,0:28:16.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你们谈过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was done.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.35,0:28:19.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没问他吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't ask him already?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.36,0:28:23.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问我什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.95,0:28:40.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得到这所房子时 这里有车架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I got the place, there was that frame
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.88,0:28:42.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有些零件和设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and some parts and equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.42,0:28:44.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前住这里的人造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever lived here built them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.22,0:28:49.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些零件也太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a lot of parts for one bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.81,0:28:52.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我每次出去看到什么零件 都会带回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whenever I came across any parts out there, I brought them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.35,0:28:54.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该拿什么零件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know what I'd need.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.66,0:28:58.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总以为我能学会怎么做 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always thought I'd learn how to do it, but
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.43,0:29:03.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你知道该怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get the feeling you already know what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.25,0:29:07.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重点是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.76,0:29:10.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要一辆摩托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're going to need a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.20,0:29:14.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.84,0:29:19.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉迪安娜别给你安排工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told Deanna not to give you a job
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.32,0:29:23.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我已为你准备了一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I think I have one for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.76,0:29:28.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你成为亚历山大的另一位招募员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like you to be Alexandria's other recruiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.37,0:29:31.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再让埃里克冒生命危险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want Eric risking his life anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.95,0:29:36.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想让我冒生命危险 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me risking mine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.09,0:29:39.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 因为你做事有分寸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, because you know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.56,0:29:41.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在外面很厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're good out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.34,0:29:44.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不属于外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't belong out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.27,0:29:49.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道让人们了解你很难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it's hard getting used to people getting used to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.48,0:29:53.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也理解你需要偶尔出去一趟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I understand right now you need to be out there sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.76,0:29:54.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.06,0:30:03.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我希望你帮我招募的主要原因是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the main reason why I want you to help me recruit
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.47,0:30:09.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能分辨出好人和坏人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is because you do know the difference between a good person and a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.34,0:30:24.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正我也没别的事可做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got nothing else to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.24,0:30:28.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.64,0:30:30.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.99,0:30:34.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我帮你打几只兔子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get you some rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.20,0:30:37.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.30,0:30:48.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你换刀了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You packing different steel nowadays?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.08,0:30:53.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.46,0:30:57.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以刀为生 为刀而死…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Live by it, you die by it...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.59,0:31:01.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又用刀吃土豆泡芙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and eat potato puffs by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.62,0:31:09.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祈求上帝你不必再用它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pray to God you don't have to use it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.78,0:31:14.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祈求上帝你不会适应不再用它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pray to God you don't get used to not using it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.12,0:31:19.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀就在你背上…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on your back...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.22,0:31:23.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便已经卸下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even when it's off your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.98,0:31:31.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底喝了多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much have you had to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.94,0:31:36.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是大块头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a large man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.11,0:31:40.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自然喝的啤酒也多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have had many beers to make up for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.54,0:31:44.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.52,0:31:49.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通过我的勇敢搭讪…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By that brave act, I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.28,0:31:53.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我逐渐发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have come to realize that things
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.13,0:31:55.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经适应现在这样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have worked out pretty damn well for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.18,0:32:02.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.19,0:32:04.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做出了什么努力？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.92,0:32:10.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我穿上了这条裙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put on this dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.45,0:32:15.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再努力一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.75,0:32:53.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.99,0:33:00.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 你在这里做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.03,0:33:03.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟着你来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I followed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.09,0:33:06.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来指望你会再做一些饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping you were going to make more cookies,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.08,0:33:08.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你却来了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but then you came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.85,0:33:11.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以再做一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I could make more.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.74,0:33:14.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以为你做一整炉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could make a whole batch just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.32,0:33:15.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你喜欢吗？- 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Would you like that? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.15,0:33:19.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我是说 请做一些吧 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I mean, yes, please. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.25,0:33:21.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你得答应我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you've got to promise me
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.40,0:33:23.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不告诉别人我来过这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can keep it secret that I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.15,0:33:26.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我得告诉我妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'd have to tell my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.58,0:33:28.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么事都告诉我妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I tell my mom everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.26,0:33:30.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能告诉任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can never tell anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.58,0:33:32.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别是你妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}especially your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.70,0:33:37.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为如果你告诉她…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if you do...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.25,0:33:41.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某天早上 你醒来后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one morning you'll wake up...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.22,0:33:46.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会发现自己不在床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you won't be in your bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.26,0:33:48.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where will I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.30,0:33:52.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会在墙外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be outside the walls
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.54,0:33:55.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很远很远的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}far, far away
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.50,0:33:58.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被捆在树上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tied to a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.77,0:34:01.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会不停尖叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'll scream and scream
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.82,0:34:03.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你很害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you'll be so afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.46,0:34:07.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人会来救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one will come to help
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.39,0:34:10.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为没人能听见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because no one will hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.11,0:34:15.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 有些东西能听见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, something will hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.01,0:34:17.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪物会来抓你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The monsters will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.20,0:34:19.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面的那些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ones out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.20,0:34:24.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们来抓你时 你跑也跑不掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you won't be able to run away when they come for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.05,0:34:27.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们会撕碎你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they will tear you apart
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.94,0:34:31.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生吞活剥你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and eat you up all while you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.31,0:34:35.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疼得撕心裂肺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All while you can still feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.00,0:34:39.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then afterwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.31,0:34:43.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人知道你怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no one will ever know what happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.15,0:34:52.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者 你可以保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you can promise
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.97,0:34:55.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远不告诉别人你看到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not to ever tell anyone what you saw here
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.28,0:34:59.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切就不会发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then nothing will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.58,0:35:02.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还能得到饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'll get cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.59,0:35:05.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lots of cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.71,0:35:12.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你知道该怎么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what I think you should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.81,0:35:23.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,景色也挺不错的 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a pretty good view, too, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.35,0:35:30.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很久没抱过宝宝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a long time since I held one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.46,0:35:39.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她和卡尔…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She and Carl...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.47,0:35:43.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我留下的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're why I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.43,0:35:49.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你想对我说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I get what you've been telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.99,0:35:53.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.17,0:35:57.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里没那么糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here isn't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.51,0:36:05.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想抱她吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to take her?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.84,0:36:06.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.69,0:36:50.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙 加入我们吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sasha. Come join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.44,0:36:52.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证你只用听就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise all you have to do is listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.32,0:36:53.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.56,0:36:55.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.01,0:37:05.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保佑她 我不知道她为什么看那么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bless her heart. I don't get what takes her so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.00,0:37:06.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只有一本书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, we only have one copy
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.76,0:37:09.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,读书会的目的不就是让大家都能看上吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the point of book club is that we all read the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.10,0:37:11.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真希望能有牙医来我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just keep hoping that a dentist shows up at our gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.15,0:37:12.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他牙不好 - 我是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's his teeth. - I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.98,0:37:14.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新鲜的时候好吃多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's just so much better when it's fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.69,0:37:32.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新鲜的时候好吃多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's just so much better when it's fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.86,0:37:38.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙 亲爱的 你爱吃什么菜？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sasha, honey, what's your favorite meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.42,0:37:39.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想以后给你做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd love to cook it for you sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.73,0:37:41.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为每位新人都做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doing it for all the new arrivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.42,0:37:44.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不知道 - 你当然知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. - Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.19,0:37:47.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都有爱吃的菜 你的是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone has favorites. So what's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.84,0:37:50.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想吃什么都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.17,0:37:51.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just worried that I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.43,0:37:53.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做了你不爱吃的菜 你懂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}end up cooking something you hate, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.44,0:37:54.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你担心吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.39,0:37:58.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你担心的就是这个吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you worry about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.59,0:38:19.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力弄明白是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to figure out what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.68,0:38:22.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What it is exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.96,0:38:29.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.30,0:38:35.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.95,0:38:37.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙 你经历了很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sasha, you've been through a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.89,0:38:40.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点我明白 但是你刚说的话…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I accept that, but what you just said...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.70,0:38:44.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是胡话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.31,0:39:04.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.74,0:39:07.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我想了想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.91,0:39:09.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的需要枪吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we really need these?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.48,0:39:13.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果事情变糟了 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, things go bad, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.35,0:39:16.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该做什么做什么 但是如你所说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do what we gotta do, but it's like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.21,0:39:17.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要枪也能解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need these for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.73,0:39:19.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.68,0:39:24.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是想让我试试吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted me to try, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.82,0:39:26.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.87,0:40:41.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Rick.
